[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pardon us! Is anyone home?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの……ごほっ。どちら様ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... *cough* Who's there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄さん。なんだか声が苦しそうだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something's wrong. That voice sounds pained."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……\n俺たちはランターナ王国から来た者だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... We're envoys from the Kingdom of Lantarna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ、お入りください……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please, come in..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ、こちらへ……ごほっ、けほっ……\nお話くらいなら、聞けますから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This way, please... *cough, cough* I can at least hear what you have to say..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いえ。すごく具合が悪そうだし……\n僕たちなら出直します。ね、兄さん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, you seem really unwell... We can come back another time. Right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。話ならまた今度聞けばいい。\nどうか休んでくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. We can talk later. Please, get some rest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごほっ。私なら大丈夫です。\n私、病気になってからずっと、こんな調子なんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*cough* I'll be fine. I've been like this ever since I got sick."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、今日はどのようなご用事で？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, what brings you here today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここ最近海で起きている事件に関連して、\n君の父親について聞きたいんだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're looking into the incidents that have been happening at sea recently. We wanted to ask about your father..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうでしたか……こほっ。\nお父さん、このところずっと帰っていなくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... *cough* My father hasn't come home in a while..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どこにいるか、無事でいるのかも分からず……\nせめてリンデ祭には、帰って来てほしいのに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know where he is or if he's safe... I just hope he'll be back by the Linde Festival..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……心配ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That must be... really worrying."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。こんな私の面倒を見ながら、\n何も言わず、一生懸命働いてくれていて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. He's been working so hard without complaint, taking care of me in this condition."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私なんて重荷のはずなのに……ごほっ。病を癒そうと、\n色々なことを試してくれて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I must be such a burden... *cough* But he keeps trying different things to help cure my illness..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "重荷なんかじゃない。娘の君を助けたいだけだろう。\n大切な家族なんだから、当たり前のことだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're not a burden. He just wants to help his daughter. That's what family does—it's only natural."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は……はい。ごほっ。お父さんは……\nかっこいい私の英雄なんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes. *cough* My father is... my hero."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……ただ無事に帰って来てくれれば……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... I just want him to come home safe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっと、すぐに帰って来ますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sure he'll be back soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕の兄さんも同じなんです。\n僕のことになると一生懸命で……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My brother's the same way. When it comes to me, he'll do anything..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕が病気で起き上がれない時も、必死で治す方法を\n探し回って……それからちゃんと戻ってくれました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When I was too sick to get out of bed, he searched desperately for a way to cure me... and then he came back to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから君のお父さんも、きっと帰って来ますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I'm sure your father will come home too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君の父親のことは、俺たちが探そう。\n見つけたら、早く帰るように伝えておく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll search for your father. When we find him, we'll tell him to come home right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……ありがとうございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]